{"about_the_game":"'Elon Simulator' is an immersive 'Trillionaire Simulator' with dozens of fun mechanics and activities to engage in!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe year is 2030, and the Earth is starved for Lithium. <br />\r\nGood thing you have an ample supply of it, right outside your Private Luxury Space-Station!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs Elon, you can:<br />\r\n     Smoke Weed (a lot)<br />\r\n     Print your own money<br />\r\n     Purchase and Create Corporations<br />\r\n     Blow your money on expensive toys<br />\r\n     Explore space in your 'Iron Billionaire' Suit<br />\r\n     Go 'Lithium Hunting' in your Flying SpaceCar (Then sell the lithium back to Earth for BILLIONS $$$)<br />\r\n     Make MILLIONS while you sleep in real life...<br />\r\n     Play on the Holo-Table<br />\r\n     Become a TRILLIONAIRE<br />\r\n     ...and lots more....<br />\r\n<br />\r\n     All from the comfort of your gigantic Luxury Space station, which is headed to Mars for permanent residence!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are Elon: the richest man in the Galaxy. And you can afford anything you want.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI made this game as a skills test and to pad my portfolio for future employers to see... and also to let people have fun in deep space with unlimited earning potential. Have fun!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2534670?t=1699454508","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1699454508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1699454508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1699454508","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"As Elon, you have the option to smoke weed as often as you like. You even have a weed-themed vending machine that dispenses blunts."},"detailed_description":"'Elon Simulator' is an immersive 'Trillionaire Simulator' with dozens of fun mechanics and activities to engage in!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe year is 2030, and the Earth is starved for Lithium. <br />\r\nGood thing you have an ample supply of it, right outside your Private Luxury Space-Station!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs Elon, you can:<br />\r\n     Smoke Weed (a lot)<br />\r\n     Print your own money<br />\r\n     Purchase and Create Corporations<br />\r\n     Blow your money on expensive toys<br />\r\n     Explore space in your 'Iron Billionaire' Suit<br />\r\n     Go 'Lithium Hunting' in your Flying SpaceCar (Then sell the lithium back to Earth for BILLIONS $$$)<br />\r\n     Make MILLIONS while you sleep in real life...<br />\r\n     Play on the Holo-Table<br />\r\n     Become a TRILLIONAIRE<br />\r\n     ...and lots more....<br />\r\n<br />\r\n     All from the comfort of your gigantic Luxury Space station, which is headed to Mars for permanent residence!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are Elon: the richest man in the Galaxy. And you can afford anything you want.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI made this game as a skills test and to pad my portfolio for future employers to see... and also to let people have fun in deep space with unlimited earning potential. Have fun!","developers":["Anark Studios","Crowbar Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534670/header.jpg?t=1699454508","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256960796,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256960796/movie480.mp4?t=1697740873","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256960796/movie